xbox_set_guest_event: set a guest event from host code

An HLE layer finishing work the title waits on needs to signal the
guest's event handle: Jedi Starfighter waits on its DirectSound stream
packets' completion events (a voice line done) before its mission script
goes on. Resolves the handle as NtSetEvent does.

--- a/src/kernel/kernel_bridge.c
+++ b/src/kernel/kernel_bridge.c
@@ -1769,6 +1769,15 @@
     g_eax = (uint32_t)xbox_NtSetEvent(handle, XBOX_TO_NATIVE(prev));
 }
 
+/* NtSetEvent for host code: an HLE layer finishing work the title waits on
+ * (a DirectSound stream packet's completion event, set from the mixer's
+ * thread) signals the guest's event handle here. Nonzero when it was set. */
+int xbox_set_guest_event(uint32_t token)
+{
+    HANDLE handle = bridge_resolve_handle(token);
+    return handle && xbox_NtSetEvent(handle, NULL) == 0;
+}
+
